&_p]:mb-2.5 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:mb-2.5 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ol]:mb-2.5 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-5 [&_li]:mb-1 [&_code]:rounded [&_code]:bg-bg [&_code]:px-1 [&_code]:py-0.5 [&_code]:font-mono [&_code]:text-[11px] [&_code]:text-text [&_table]:mb-3 [&_table]:w-full [&_table]:text-left [&_table]:text-[11.5px] [&_th]:border-b [&_th]:border-border [&_th]:pb-1 [&_th]:pr-3 [&_th]:font-semibold [&_th]:text-text [&_td]:border-b [&_td]:border-border [&_td]:py-1 [&_td]:pr-3 [&_td]:align-top [&_a]:text-teal hover:[&_a]:underline [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-border2 [&_blockquote]:pl-3 [&_blockquote]:italic","children":[["$","h1","h1-0",{"children":"Physical Settlement of Stock F&O"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["Index derivatives settle in cash. ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Stock derivatives settle in shares."}]," This\r\ndistinction is the source of more unexpected obligations than any other feature\r\nof the Indian market, because it converts a position sized against margin into\r\nan obligation sized against full contract value."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"Mandatory for all stock F&O since April 2018."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"children":"What settles and what does not"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"At expiry:"}],"\n",["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Position"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Outcome"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock future, long"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Take delivery of shares"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock future, short"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Deliver shares"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock option, ITM long call"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Take delivery — pay full contract value"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock option, ITM short call"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Deliver shares — must own or buy them"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock option, ITM long put"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Deliver shares — must own or buy them"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-5",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stock option, ITM short put"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Take delivery — pay full contract value"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-6",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Any OTM option"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Expires worthless, no obligation"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-7",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Any index option"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Cash settled, no obligation"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["Settlement occurs on ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"expiry plus two trading days (E+2)"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"children":"Delivery margins"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Exchanges do not wait until expiry to collect. Delivery margin begins accruing\r\n",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"four trading days before expiry"}]," and increases each day until settlement."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"With NSE stock F&O expiring on the last Tuesday, that means margin starts\r\nbuilding from the preceding Wednesday. A position that was comfortable on\r\nTuesday of the prior week can face a materially higher margin requirement by\r\nFriday, purely from the calendar, with no change in the underlying."}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":"This is the mechanism that surfaces a settlement problem before settlement\r\nrather than at it. It is also why positions in stock contracts are frequently\r\nclosed in the week before expiry regardless of view — the margin becomes\r\npunitive relative to the remaining opportunity."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"children":"Why defined risk does not mean defined cash"}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":"This is the part that matters most and is least obvious."}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":["A bull put spread on a stock is a defined-risk position: maximum loss is the\r\nspread width minus the credit. If the underlying settles ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"between"}]," the\r\nstrikes, the short put is assigned and the long put expires worthless."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-9",{"children":["The economic loss is still bounded. The ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"cash requirement is not related to\r\nit"}],". Assignment on the short put obliges taking delivery of the full contract\r\nvalue in shares on E+2 — an amount that can be many times the position's\r\nmaximum loss and many times the margin that was blocked."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-10",{"children":"The same asymmetry applies to every defined-risk stock structure where one leg\r\nfinishes in the money and the other does not: vertical spreads, condors,\r\nbutterflies. The wings bound the loss; they do not bound the settlement."}],"\n",["$","p","p-11",{"children":"An account can therefore hold a position that is correctly sized by every risk\r\nmeasure and still be unable to settle it."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-3",{"children":"The OTM exception"}],"\n",["$","p","p-12",{"children":"Out-of-the-money options expire worthless with no delivery obligation. This is\r\nwhy the entire issue disappears for positions closed before expiry, and why\r\nstock option positions are so often squared off rather than held to\r\nsettlement."}],"\n",["$","p","p-13",{"children":["Closing the position in the market before expiry removes both the settlement\r\nobligation and the exercised-option STT charge described in\r\n",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"india-market-structure/transaction-costs.md"}],". These are two independent\r\nreasons pointing the same way."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-4",{"children":"Index contracts"}],"\n",["$","p","p-14",{"children":"NIFTY, BANKNIFTY, FINNIFTY, MIDCPNIFTY, NIFTYNXT50 and SENSEX are cash\r\nsettled. There is no delivery leg, no delivery margin, and no share\r\nobligation. The difference in operational risk between an index condor and the\r\nsame structure on a single stock is large and is not visible in the payoff\r\ndiagram."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-5",{"children":"Corporate actions"}],"\n",["$","p","p-15",{"children":"Stock contracts spanning a dividend, bonus, split or merger are adjusted by the\r\nexchange — strike prices and market lots are revised so that position value is\r\npreserved. A spread's width can change as a result, altering the structure's\r\neconomics mid-position. Stock options in India are American-style and can be\r\nassigned early, which becomes rational for a counterparty ahead of a large\r\ndividend."}],"\n",["$","p","p-16",{"children":"Index options are European-style and cannot be assigned before expiry."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-6",{"children":"Related"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"india-market-structure/transaction-costs.md"}]," — exercised-option STT"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"india-market-structure/expiry-architecture.md"}]," — when stock contracts expire"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"strategies/vertical-spreads/bull-put-spread.md"}]," — the assignment asymmetry in context"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"fundamentals/corporate-actions.md"}]," — contract adjustment"]}],"\n"]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-faint","children":["Educational material describing how a structure behaves. Not a recommendation, not a signal, and not personalised advice. Source: ",["$","code",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"docs/learning/india-market-structure/physical-settlement.md"}]]}]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","(workspace)","children","le